  Write, draw, build and check architecture specifications sourced from
  Markdown sections. Use for Markdown specification authoring, figure changes,
  section lint and reproducible single-file builds. Do not use for SDoc,
  StrictDoc or Requirements System documents (use-requirements-system), or
